OL,3,GNEWSATheatre company helping mums stay
OL,4,Ain the spotlight
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's so special to be given the
OL,7,Fopportunity to not choose between
OL,8,Fmotherhood and career. It should be the
OL,9,Fnorm," says Finetta Sidgwick.
OL,11,FShe is a dancer and is 14 weeks
OL,12,Fpregnant. Thanks to a special theatre
OL,13,Fcompany in Essex, she is still taking
OL,14,Fto the stage.
OL,16,FThe Rhiannon Faith Company (RFC) is
OL,17,Fpaying for childcare and supporting
OL,18,Fperformers with young families,
OL,19,Fincluding helping one dancer take her
OL,20,Fchildren on tour.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
